 476→                        </div>\n   477→                        <div class=\"insight-description\">\n   478→                            OpenAI announced biosafety bounty for GPT 5.5 with rewards for identifying safety issues in biological applications.\n   479→                        </div>\n   480→                        <div class=\"insight-meta\">\n   481→                            OpenAI via Hacker News | 2026-04-26\n   482→                        </div>\n   483→                        <div class=\"insight-topics\">\n   484→                            <span class=\"tag\">OpenAI</span>\n   485→                            <span class=\"tag\">AI safety</span>\n   486→                            <span class=\"tag\">GPT-5.5</span>\n   487→                        </div>\n   488→                    </div>\n   489→\n   490→                    <div class=\"insight-item\">\n   491→                        <div class=\"insight-title\">\n   492→                            <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=40384567\" class=\"external-link\" target=\"_blank\">Karpathy-style LLM wiki</a>\n   493→                        </div>\n   494→                        <div class=\"insight-description\">\n   495→                            AI agents maintain LLM wiki automatically using Markdown and Git, demonstrating self-documenting agentic systems.\n   496→                        </div>\n   497→                        <div class=\"insight-meta\">\n   498→                            nex-crm via Hacker News | 2026-04-26\n   499→                        </div>\n   500→                        <div class=\"insight-topics\">\n   501→                            <span class=\"tag\">AI agents</span>\n   502→                            <span class=\"tag\">LLM</span>\n   503→                            <span class=\"tag\">Git</span>\n   504→                        </div>\n   505→                    </div>\n   506→\n   507→                    <div class=\"insight-item\">\n   508→                        <div class=\"insight-title\">\n   509→                            <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=40383901\" class=\"external-link\" target=\"_blank\">Open source memory layer</a>\n   510→                        </div>\n   511→                        <div class=\"insight-description\">\n   512→                            Memory layer for AI agents providing persistent capabilities similar to Claude.ai and ChatGPT.\n   513→                        </div>\n   514→                        <div class=\"insight-meta\">\n   515→                            alash3al via Hacker News | 2026-04-26\n   516→                        </div>\n   517→                        <div class=\"insight-topics\">\n   518→                            <span class=\"tag\">memory</span>\n   519→                            <span class=\"tag\">open source</span>\n   520→                            <span class=\"tag\">Claude</span>\n   521→                        </div>\n   522→                    </div>\n   523→\n   524→                    <div class=\"insight-item\">\n   525→                        <div class=\"insight-title\">\n   526→                            <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=40385123\" class=\"external-link\" target=\"_blank\">Lambda Calculus Benchmark</a>\n   527→                        </div>\n   528→                        <div class=\"insight-description\">\n   529→                            Lambda Calculus as benchmark for AI reasoning capabilities to test computational reasoning in LLMs.\n   530→                        </div>\n   531→                        <div class=\"insight-meta\">\n   532→                            victortaelin via Hacker News | 2026-04-26\n   533→                        </div>\n   534→                        <div class=\"insight-topics\">\n   535→                            <span class=\"tag\">AI benchmarks</span>\n   536→                            <span class=\"tag\">reasoning</span>\n   537→                            <span class=\"tag\">LLM evaluation</span>\n   538→                        </div>\n   539→                    </div>\n   540→\n   541→                    <div class=\"insight-item\">\n   542→                        <div class=\"insight-title\">\n   543→                            <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=40379245\" class=\"external-link\" target=\"_blank\">Google $40B Anthropic investment</a>\n   544→                        </div>\n   545→                        <div class=\"insight-description\">\n   546→                            Bloomberg reports Google's planned $40B investment in Anthropic, highlighting intensifying AI arms race.\n   547→                        </div>\n   548→                        <div class=\"insight-meta\">\n   549→                            Bloomberg via Hacker News | 2026-04-25\n   550→                        </div>\n   551→                        <div class=\"insight-topics\">\n   552→                            <span class=\"tag\">Anthropic</span>\n   553→                            <span class=\"tag\">Google</span>\n   554→                            <span class=\"tag\">funding</span>\n   555→                        </div>\n   556→                    </div>\n   557→\n   558→                    <div class=\"insight-item\">\n   559→                        <div class=\"insight-title\">\n   560→                            <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Apr/24/deepseek-v4/\" class=\"external-link\" target=\"_blank\">DeepSeek V4 analysis</a>\n   561→                        </div>\n   562→                        <div class=\"insight-description\">\n   563→                            DeepSeek V4 preview models offer near-frontier performance at significantly lower costs than Western competitors.\n   564→                        </div>\n   565→                        <div class=\"insight-meta\">\n   566→                            Simon Willison | 2026-04-24\n   567→                        